   A quote of the Strata engine's source code belongs to the engine, and the engine's own terms apply to it: this
   permission grants nothing over it.

2. Third-party material. The fonts, scripts and other files of other authors that the site ships, the libraries the
   book quotes, and the assets of other authors the book shows and gives out keep their own licenses and notices.
